rue"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="font-medium text-paper" aria-current="page">Strategic Research &amp; Feasibility</span></li></ol></nav></div><main><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper md:text-[3rem]">Strategic Research &amp; Feasibility</h1><p class="mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-paper/80">Data-driven market research and feasibility studies that turn information into strategic advantage — for MSMEs, institutions and industry bodies making critical decisions.</p></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Decisions Without Data Are Just Opinions</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Most organisations make critical decisions — entering new markets, launching new products, setting up new facilities — based on assumptions rather than evidence. The result is wasted capital, missed opportunities and failed ventures. SBC&#x27;s Strategic Research &amp; Feasibility division provides rigorous, data-driven research that gives decision-makers the confidence to act — or the clarity to pivot before it&#x27;s too late.</p></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal flex flex-col justify-center gap-3"><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">MSMEs planning expansion or new ventures</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Institutions requiring market studies before setup</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Industry bodies needing sector analysis &amp; data</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Government bodies requiring evidence-based research</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Organisations seeking DPRs for funding or approvals</div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Our Research Edge</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="min-w-0 border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><p class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gold-deep md:text-4xl">0+</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Published Research Papers — SEM/AMOS Expertise</p></div><div class="min-w-0 border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><p class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gold-deep md:text-4xl">PhD</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Research-Grade Rigour in Every Study &amp; Report</p></div><div class="min-w-0 border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><p class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gold-deep md:text-4xl">0+</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Years of Applied Research Across Sectors &amp; Domains</p></div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Research &amp; Feasibility Services</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-line size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Market Research</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Comprehensive market analysis — market size, demand assessment, competitor landscape, customer segmentation and growth potential.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard-list size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="M12 11h4"></path><path d="M12 16h4"></path><path d="M8 11h.01"></path><path d="M8 16h.01"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Feasibility Studies</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Technical, financial and operational feasibility assessment for new ventures, expansions, product launches and institutional setups.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">DPR Preparation</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Detailed Project Reports for funding applications, government approvals, bank loans and investor presentations — research-backed and audit-ready.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Sector &amp; Industry Studies</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">In-depth sector analysis for industry associations, government bodies and corporates — trends, challenges, opportunities and strategic recommendations.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-graduation-cap size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Academic &amp; Applied Research</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Primary and secondary research using rigorous methodology — SEM/AMOS, quantitative and qualitative frameworks for data-driven decision making.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Strategic Advisory</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Translating research findings into actionable strategy — market entry, expansion planning, diversification and investment decision support.</p></article></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Our Research Process</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-9"><ol class="divide-y divide-ink-tint border-t border-ink-tint"><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-64"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">01</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Brief &amp; Scope Definition</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Understanding your decision context, research objectives, timelines and deliverable format — defining a clear scope before work begins.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-64"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">02</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Primary &amp; Secondary Research</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Data collection through field surveys, stakeholder interviews, government databases, industry reports and published research — rigorous and multi-source.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-64"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">03</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Analysis &amp; Interpretation</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Quantitative and qualitative analysis using proven frameworks — SEM/AMOS, financial modelling, competitive benchmarking and scenario planning.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-64"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">04</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Report &amp; Recommendations</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Clear, structured reports with executive summary, findings, insights and actionable recommendations — designed for decision-makers, not academics.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-64"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">05</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Presentation &amp; Advisory</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Board or leadership presentation of findings — walking decision-makers through insights, answering questions and supporting strategic decisions.</p></li></ol></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink text-paper"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-paper md:text-[2.5rem]">Need Research You Can Actually Act On?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-paper/80">Let&#x27;s discuss your research needs. Book a consultation and find out how SBC can help you make better decisions.</p></section></div></section><section id="book" aria-labelledby="cta-heading" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-gold-wash"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 id="cta-heading" class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.75rem]">Start With a Free 45-Minute Business Audit</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">No commitment. No jargon. Just clarity on where your business stands and what needs to change.</p><a href="/book-free-audit" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-8 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book Your Free Audit <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidd